#The name of this file is the name of your creature. Multiple TP files can exist in the CustomCentis folder. PNG files in the CustomCentis folder will be automatically loaded (atlas text is optional). Remove / Add # to uncomment / comment. Spaces and empty lines are ignored. Decimal numbers use dots as points. Any invalid entry will be ignored. Define at most one field per line. Field names are CASE SENSITIVE.
